oaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-16T16:00:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UTEP fires head coach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-16T14:25:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T13:48:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026-27 Week 11 College Football Playoff, bowl projections","description":"Our bowl gurus take a look at how the postseason picture shifted after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:28:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473016/2026-week-11-college-football-playoff-bowl-projections","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura and Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football takeaways: Lasting impressions from Week 11","description":"Our college football experts break down the most important things they saw in Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:21:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/mondaytakeaways111626/2026-college-football-takeaways-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5154734/griffin-wilde","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Griffin Wilde","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Griffin Wilde is an American college football wide receiver for the Northwestern Wildcats. He previously played for the South Dakota State Jackrabbits.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilde attended Thomas Jefferson High School in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. Over his junior and senior seasons he combined for 100 receptions for 1,858 yards with 22 touchdowns. Wilde committed to South Dakota State University to play college football. He also played basketball in high school."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Wilde was a starter his true freshman year at South Dakota State in 2023 and had 20 receptions for 399 yards and six touchdowns. He became the Jackrabbits number one receiver in 2024, recording 71 receptions for 1,147 yards and 12 touchdowns. After the season, Wilde entered the transfer portal and transferred to Northwestern University. He was a starter his first year at Northwestern in 2025. In their upset victory over the Penn State Nittany Lions, he had seven receptions for 94 yards and a touchdown. Wilde was named MVP of the 2025 GameAbove Sports Bowl. In 2026, Wilde faced his former team and recorded three receptions for 104 yards in an 34-18 win."}]}}